{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 22,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.9635620117188,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "agents, and they provide mutation-specific data for common variants. Testing platforms have",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.9150390625,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "been designed for a reference laboratory setting and are most applicable to high TB burden",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        307.4281005859375,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "countries. Results can be obtained in 5 hours  . (5)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        125.14878845214844,
        309.68170166015625,
        139.23678588867188
      ],
      "text": "Targeted next-generation sequencing tests",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        149.90380859375,
        526.9589233398438,
        163.04881286621094
      ],
      "text": "Tests based on targeted next-generation sequencing (NGS) are used for follow-on detection",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        165.40380859375,
        527.0028686523438,
        178.54881286621094
      ],
      "text": "of resistance to a broad range of anti-TB drugs after the initial detection of TB or of rifampicin",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        180.90380859375,
        526.9644775390625,
        194.04881286621094
      ],
      "text": "resistance. This class of tests is based on technology that combines amplification of selected",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        196.40380859375,
        527.0249633789062,
        209.54881286621094
      ],
      "text": "genes with NGS to detect resistance to many drugs with a single test. Because targeted NGS",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        211.90380859375,
        526.8866577148438,
        225.04881286621094
      ],
      "text": "can interrogate entire genes to identify specific mutations associated with resistance, the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        227.40380859375,
        526.8997802734375,
        240.54881286621094
      ],
      "text": "accuracy may be better than that of existing WHO-recommended rapid diagnostic tests (WRDs).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.945565223693848,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        242.90380859375,
        526.9590454101562,
        256.048828125
      ],
      "text": "In addition, new tests based on targeted NGS can detect resistance to new and repurposed",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        258.40380859375,
        526.9810180664062,
        271.548828125
      ],
      "text": "drugs that are not currently included in any other molecular assays. Hence, this class of tests",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.90380859375,
        526.853515625,
        287.048828125
      ],
      "text": "offers great potential to provide comprehensive resistance detection matched to modern",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        289.40380859375,
        171.37208557128906,
        302.548828125
      ],
      "text": "treatment regimens.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        314.8734130859375,
        245.6393280029297,
        331.3094177246094
      ],
      "text": "1.3.4 Tests for TB infection",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        342.5299987792969,
        231.417724609375,
        356.6180114746094
      ],
      "text": "Mtb antigen-based skin tests",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.284912109375,
        526.9798583984375,
        380.429931640625
      ],
      "text": "antigen-based skin tests (TBSTs) are used for the indirect detection of TB infection. TBSTs  Mtb",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        382.784912109375,
        526.8817749023438,
        395.929931640625
      ],
      "text": "rely on intradermal injection of  -specific antigens; the antigens elicit a localized skin reaction  Mtb",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.945866584777832,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        398.284912109375,
        526.9883422851562,
        411.429931640625
      ],
      "text": "in infected individuals that is detected by measurement of a local induration 48–72 hours after",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.983938217163086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        413.784912109375,
        526.9699096679688,
        426.929931640625
      ],
      "text": "administration. Although these tests continue to rely on patient injection and return visits for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        429.284912109375,
        526.9580688476562,
        442.429931640625
      ],
      "text": "result interpretation, they are more specific than the WHO-recommended tuberculin skin tests",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.984238624572754,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        444.784912109375,
        101.96308898925781,
        457.929931640625
      ],
      "text": "(TSTs).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        469.7724914550781,
        254.45420837402344,
        483.8605041503906
      ],
      "text": "Interferon-gamma release assays",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        494.5274963378906,
        527.1461791992188,
        507.6725158691406
      ],
      "text": "Interferon-gamma release assays (IGRAs) are in vitro blood-based tests that are used to indirectly",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        510.0274658203125,
        527.0140991210938,
        523.1724853515625
      ],
      "text": "test for TB infection. They do this by measuring either the amount of interferon-gamma that is",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.995849609375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        525.5274658203125,
        526.9498901367188,
        538.6724853515625
      ],
      "text": "released by lymphocytes in whole blood after exposure to  -specific antigens or the number  Mtb",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.97216510772705,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        541.0274658203125,
        526.558349609375,
        554.1724853515625
      ],
      "text": "of T-lymphocytes within the whole blood that produce interferon-gamma. IGRA testing requires",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        556.5274658203125,
        526.965087890625,
        569.6724853515625
      ],
      "text": "days to perform owing to the blood incubation steps and it can be challenging to perform",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        572.0274658203125,
        527.0765991210938,
        585.1724853515625
      ],
      "text": "among patients for whom phlebotomy can be difficult (e.g. children); however, this is the only",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.998950004577637,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        587.5275268554688,
        524.5250244140625,
        600.6725463867188
      ],
      "text": "type of test for TB infection in which the results are not affected by prior bacille Calmette–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        603.0275268554688,
        526.9259643554688,
        616.1725463867188
      ],
      "text": "Guérin (BCG) vaccination for TB. Hence, IGRAs are a promising alternative for detection of TB",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        618.5275268554688,
        340.8240966796875,
        631.6725463867188
      ],
      "text": "infection in settings with high rates of BCG vaccination.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        643.5150146484375,
        183.1453399658203,
        657.6029663085938
      ],
      "text": "Tuberculin skin tests",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        668.2698974609375,
        526.966552734375,
        681.4149169921875
      ],
      "text": "TSTs were the first class of tests to be recommended for detection of TB infection; they rely",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        683.7698974609375,
        526.96142578125,
        696.9149169921875
      ],
      "text": "on intradermal injection of a mix of antigens to  , non-tuberculous mycobacteria and the  Mtb",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        699.2698974609375,
        526.9258422851562,
        712.4149169921875
      ],
      "text": "BCG vaccine formulation, followed by detection of a localized skin induration-based response",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        714.7698974609375,
        527.0139770507812,
        727.9149169921875
      ],
      "text": "after 48–72 hours. As with the TBSTs, these tests can facilitate TB infection testing in children",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        730.2698974609375,
        526.6729125976562,
        743.4149169921875
      ],
      "text": "and other patients for whom phlebotomy is challenging, but they may also produce false",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        745.7698974609375,
        527.2233276367188,
        758.9149169921875
      ],
      "text": "positive results in people infected with mycobacteria other than TB and in those who are",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        761.2698974609375,
        149.61480712890625,
        774.4149169921875
      ],
      "text": "BCG vaccinated.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        43.05839920043945,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "6 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}